### Content Understanding REST API 测试
### VS Code REST Client 格式 — 安装 REST Client 扩展后可直接点击 "Send Request"
###
### 使用前设置变量：
###   @endpoint = 你的 CU 端点
###   @apiKey = 你的 API Key
###   @apiVersion = 2025-11-01

@endpoint = https://ai-foundary-hu-sweden-central2.services.ai.azure.com
@apiKey = YOUR_API_KEY_HERE
@apiVersion = 2025-11-01
@analyzerIdContent = rubricContent5c32107a
@analyzerIdVoice = rubricVoice5c32107a
@testAnalyzerId = testAnalyzerHttpTest

### ============================================================
### 1. 列出所有 Analyzers (GA API)
### ============================================================

GET {{endpoint}}/contentunderstanding/analyzers?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}

### ============================================================
### 2. 列出所有 Analyzers (Preview API — 用于对比)
### ============================================================

GET {{endpoint}}/contentunderstanding/analyzers?api-version=2025-05-01-preview
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}

### ============================================================
### 3. 获取特定 Content Analyzer
### ============================================================

GET {{endpoint}}/contentunderstanding/analyzers/{{analyzerIdContent}}?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}

### ============================================================
### 4. 获取特定 Voice Analyzer
### ============================================================

GET {{endpoint}}/contentunderstanding/analyzers/{{analyzerIdVoice}}?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}

### ============================================================
### 5. 创建测试 Analyzer (PUT)
### ============================================================

PUT {{endpoint}}/contentunderstanding/analyzers/{{testAnalyzerId}}?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "description": "Test analyzer for HTTP client validation",
  "baseAnalyzerId": "prebuilt-document",
  "fieldSchema": {
    "name": "TestScoring",
    "fields": {
      "test_field": {
        "type": "string",
        "method": "generate",
        "description": "Generate a simple test response. Return: {\"result\": \"ok\"}"
      }
    }
  }
}

### ============================================================
### 6. 验证测试 Analyzer 已创建
### ============================================================

GET {{endpoint}}/contentunderstanding/analyzers/{{testAnalyzerId}}?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}

### ============================================================
### 7. 提交内容分析（Content Scoring）
### 注意：body.url 是 base64 编码的 JSON transcript
### 下面的 base64 解码为：{"session":"test","conversation":[{"role":"mr","content":"Hello doctor"}]}
### ============================================================

POST {{endpoint}}/contentunderstanding/analyzers/{{analyzerIdContent}}:analyze?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "url": "data:application/json;base64,eyJzZXNzaW9uIjoidGVzdCIsImNvbnZlcnNhdGlvbiI6W3sicm9sZSI6Im1yIiwiY29udGVudCI6IkhlbGxvIGRvY3RvciJ9XX0="
}

### ============================================================
### 8. 轮询结果（替换 URL 为 Operation-Location 返回值）
### ============================================================

# GET {Operation-Location from step 7 response header}
# Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}

### ============================================================
### 9. 删除测试 Analyzer
### ============================================================

DELETE {{endpoint}}/contentunderstanding/analyzers/{{testAnalyzerId}}?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}

### ============================================================
### 10. 验证 Analyzer ID 命名规则 — 含连字符（应失败）
### ============================================================

PUT {{endpoint}}/contentunderstanding/analyzers/test-invalid-id?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "description": "Test invalid ID with hyphens",
  "baseAnalyzerId": "prebuilt-document",
  "fieldSchema": {
    "name": "Test",
    "fields": {
      "f1": { "type": "string", "method": "generate", "description": "test" }
    }
  }
}

### ============================================================
### 11. 查看 Portal URL（AI Coach API）
### 替换 rubricId 为实际值
### ============================================================

# GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/rubrics/{rubricId}/cu-portal-url
# Authorization: Bearer {admin_token}
